{"unit_id":"flluhaoran__dsh-plugin-account-balance#card-zh","repo":"flluhaoran/dsh-plugin-account-balance","commit":"17eb31cdb039d48f570ff6bab6b8f1175feb61b8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-account-balance 是一款 DSH 网页插件，在侧边栏设置按钮旁展示当前模型提供商的账户余额。它在 host 注册余额查询路由，并在网页端替换侧边栏设置外壳、并排加入余额框。余额框可每五分钟自动刷新，也可点击立即刷新；查询结果显示余额和币种。当前代码只实现 deepseek-official 的余额接口，其他提供商会显示暂不支持。适合希望直接在 DSH 侧边栏查看 DeepSeek 账户余额的用户。需要在 DSH 凭据服务中配置可解析的 DeepSeek API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:80-134","lib/client.js:164-190","lib/client.js:441-471"]}
{"unit_id":"flluhaoran__dsh-plugin-account-balance#card-en","repo":"flluhaoran/dsh-plugin-account-balance","commit":"17eb31cdb039d48f570ff6bab6b8f1175feb61b8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-account-balance shows the current model balance beside Settings in the DSH web sidebar. It queries the host route and refreshes every five minutes or on click. Only deepseek-official balance lookup is implemented; configure its credential through DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:80-134","lib/client.js:164-190","lib/client.js:441-471"]}
{"unit_id":"flluhaoran__dsh-plugin-account-balance#feature-sidebar-balance","repo":"flluhaoran/dsh-plugin-account-balance","commit":"17eb31cdb039d48f570ff6bab6b8f1175feb61b8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-account-balance 的功能：余额侧边栏框：在 DSH 网页侧边栏的设置按钮旁显示当前提供商余额及币种；每五分钟自动查询，也支持点击刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:164-190"]}
{"unit_id":"flluhaoran__dsh-plugin-account-balance#feature-balance-endpoint","repo":"flluhaoran/dsh-plugin-account-balance","commit":"17eb31cdb039d48f570ff6bab6b8f1175feb61b8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-account-balance 的功能：DeepSeek 余额查询：host 根据当前模型提供商和凭据请求余额，并返回可用状态、币种、总额、赠送额和充值额。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:80-120"]}
